00:15.080 --> 00:15.750
Pasti berhasil.

00:15.750 --> 00:16.350
Kamu bisa masak?

00:16.350 --> 00:17.350
Pekerjakan saja seorang koki.

00:17.350 --> 00:18.070
Barbeku atau semacamnya.

00:18.070 --> 00:18.800
