01:07.950 --> 01:08.710
Berhenti!

01:08.920 --> 01:09.770
Jangan bergerak.

01:09.770 --> 01:11.070
♪ Hahahaha ♪

01:10.070 --> 01:11.090
Ayo.

01:11.120 --> 01:11.680
Kamu naik, ayo.

01:11.680 --> 01:12.070
Naik.

01:12.480 --> 01:12.960
Aku...

01:13.000 --> 01:13.510
Kamu kenapa?

01:13.510 --> 01:14.120
Naik, ayo, naik.

01:14.120 --> 01:14.870
Sialan kamu.

01:14.690 --> 01:15.620
♪ Hahahaha ♪

01:16.590 --> 01:17.560
Naik, ayo.

01:17.590 --> 01:18.120
Kenapa?

01:18.230 --> 01:18.789
Naiklah.

01:18.789 --> 01:20.000
Naik.

01:18.900 --> 01:20.060
♪ Hahahaha ♪

01:20.070 --> 01:20.680
Turun.

01:20.789 --> 01:21.580
Kenapa?

01:21.680 --> 01:22.230
Kalian...

01:22.230 --> 01:22.680
Turun.

01:22.710 --> 01:23.300
Kamu naik.

01:23.300 --> 01:24.430
Kalau berani, turunlah.

01:24.430 --> 01:25.280
Kalau berani, naiklah.

01:25.280 --> 01:25.840
Kalau kalian berani,

01:25.840 --> 01:27.640
