01:28.280 --> 01:28.789
Oke.

01:30.100 --> 01:31.300
♪ Dia ♪

01:30.560 --> 01:31.690
Persetan denganmu.

01:32.990 --> 01:37.110
♪ Di dadanya berkarat sekuntum bunga ♪

01:36.039 --> 01:37.170
Kompak sekali tadi.

01:37.509 --> 01:38.370
Orangnya mana?

01:39.180 --> 01:40.070
♪ Oh dia ♪

01:40.710 --> 01:41.440
Kamu kenapa?

01:42.030 --> 01:45.180
♪ Berkata bahwa wawasanmu
